WEBVTT

00:18:29.065 --> 00:18:33.473
So, my TED wish is for you
to help build a global system --

00:18:33.497 --> 00:18:34.976
an early-warning system --

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:38.731
to protect us against
humanity's worst nightmares.

00:18:39.381 --> 00:18:45.504
And what I thought I would call it
is "Early Detection,"

00:18:46.724 --> 00:18:48.848
But it should really be called ...

00:18:50.223 --> 00:18:51.872
"Total Early Detection."
[TED]

00:18:51.896 --> 00:18:52.979
(Laughter)

00:18:53.003 --> 00:18:54.154
What?

00:18:54.178 --> 00:19:01.163
(Applause)